Bug: When there is a resolution option, reinstalling BitmapFont will result in incorrect display.

### Current Behavior



> **视觉材料 1**：见下方对应图片。



### Expected Behavior

Text display remains unchanged

### Steps to Reproduce

```js
(async () => {
    const app = new PIXI.Application();

    await app.init({ background: '#1099bb', resizeTo: window, resolution: 1.25, antialias: true });

    document.body.appendChild(app.canvas);

    const style = new PIXI.TextStyle({
        fontFamily: 'Arial',
        fontWeight: '600',
        fill: 0xffffff,
        fontSize: 108,
        letterSpacing: 4,
    });

    PIXI.BitmapFontManager.install({
        name: 'myFont',
        style,
        chars: '0123456789',
        resolution: 1.25,
    });

    for (let i = 0; i < 10; i++) {
        const x = (i % 5) * 250;
        const y = Math.floor(i / 5) * 250;
        const n = (Math.random() * 10000) >> 0;
        const text = new PIXI.BitmapText({
            text: n.toString(),
            style: {
                fontFamily: 'myFont',
                fontSize: 108,
            }
        });
        text.position.set(x, y);
        app.stage.addChild(text);
    }

    setInterval(() => {
        PIXI.BitmapFontManager.uninstall('myFont');
        PIXI.BitmapFontManager.install({
            name: 'myFont',
            style,
            chars: '0123456789',
            resolution: 1.25,
        });
        app.stage.children
            .filter(child => child instanceof PIXI.BitmapText)
            .forEach((text) => text.onViewUpdate());
    }, 1000);
})();
```

### Environment

- **`pixi.js` version**: *8.9.1*
- **Browser & Version**: *Microsoft Edge 134.0.3124.93*
- **OS & Version**: *Windows 11*
- **Running Example**: *https://pixiplayground.com/#/edit/vPPVgsBn_aGDKWNfk3ufC*


### Possible Solution

_No response_

